EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Up for some power hide-and-seek? {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Huh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} What are you laughing about?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Power hide-and-seek is a real thing!
It's a total-body workout!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}OK, so it's exactly like regular hide-
and-seek.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} But we as individuals can
add the "power" element to it!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}How about it then?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You up for it?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Yeah, I'm in!
Count me out.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Güç saklambacına var mısın?
{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Neye gülüyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Güç saklambacı
gerçek bir şey! Tüm vücudu çalıştırır!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}
Tamam, normal saklambaçla birebir aynı.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ama o “güç” kısmını biz kendimiz
katabiliriz!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ne dersin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Var
mısın?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Evet, varım!
Beni saymayın.

